<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVkd&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Logo"></font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Ref No: {!Case.CaseNumber}</font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Dear {!Case.First_Name__c},</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Thanks for contacting us regarding your experience at {!Case.Departure_Airport__c} airport on {!Case.TECH_Email_Departure_Date_Time__c}.&nbsp;</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><font size="2">-<i>If cleanliness add:-</i></font></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">I was concerned to read of your disappointment with the <b>-<i>Qantas Club/Business/First Lounge-</i></b> facilities prior to your QF{!Case.Flight_Number__c} flight. We are committed to being the best airline for business and premium travellers, and work hard to ensure all our lounges maintain the highest standards of cleanliness. I am sorry this was not your experience during your visit.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">I have taken immediate steps to address this with our staff and cleaning contractors to ensure our standards are met and maintained. First-hand experience like yours is vital to our improvement process so we appreciate your feedback.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><font size="2">-<i>If general facilities add:-</i></font></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">I regret your disappointment with the <b>-<i>chairs/computers/upholstery etc-</i></b> in our <b>-<i>Qantas Club/Business/First Lounge-</i></b><i> </i>prior to your flight QF{!Case.Flight_Number__c}.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">We put a high priority on the quality of everything we provide onboard, and our Lounge Product team put care and thought into choosing <b>-f<i>urniture/lighting/a colour scheme etc-</i></b> that appeal to a broad a range of tastes. At the same time, we are constantly reviewing this aspect of our service and I know the team will want to know how you felt about this.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">I’m grateful for you taking the time to get in touch with us about this, and I hope that we can make you more comfortable next time you visit our lounge.</font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Kind regards</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">{!User.FirstName}</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Qantas Customer Care</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVke&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Qantas_Logo"></font></p><p style=""><span style="font-size: small; color: white; font-family: arial, sans-serif; text-align: center;"><br></span></p><p style=""><span style="font-size: small; color: white; font-family: arial, sans-serif; text-align: center;"><br></span></p><p style=""><span style="font-size: small; color: white; font-family: arial, sans-serif; text-align: center;">!Case.Thread_Token}</span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2">Qantas Airways Limited, ABN 16 009 661 901</font></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2">10 Bourke Road Mascot NSW 2020 Australia&nbsp;</font></p><p style="text-align: center;"><br></p><p style="font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><span style="text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************** PLEASE CONSIDER OUR ENVIRONMENT BEFORE PRINTING *****************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="1" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="text-align: left;">*********************************************** Confidentiality and Privilege Notice **********************************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font></p><p><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">This e-mail is intended only to be read or used by the addressee. It is confidential and may contain legally privileged information. If you are not the addressee indicated in this message (or responsible for delivery of the message to such person), you may not copy or deliver this message to anyone, and you should destroy this message and kindly notify the sender by reply e-mail. Confidentiality and legal privilege are not waived or lost by</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">reason of mistaken delivery to you. Qantas Airways Limited ABN 16 009 661 901&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************************************************************************************************************************</span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
